ooks for enhancing communication skills. Covering topics from negotiation and persuasive speaking to building deeper relationships and mastering presentations, these expert-reviewed titles offer practical strategies for improving both personal and professional interactions.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--1KxV4ohY--/f_auto/v1722860400/public/Placeholder%2007","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-03T14:06:06.253Z"},{"id":"PYoYNbab0","title":"Top 9 books for career advancement","url":"https://www.happycoders.eu/books/genres/career-development/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-9-best-career-development-books-pyoynbab0","summary":"Explore a curated list of top career development books that provide valuable insights to enhance your professional journey. Discover works by authors like Cal Newport and John Sonmez, offering guidance on developing essential skills and achieving career success. Each book summary highlights key takeaways for advancing in any profession.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e6991ce0b8e3401a6e83ad68eea38551?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-03T14:06:06.209Z"},{"id":"fn3XVqa6k","title":"Top 19 books to enhance your management skills","url":"https://www.happycoders.eu/books/genres/management/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-19-best-management-books-fn3xvqa6k","summary":"Explore a curated list of 19 essential management books that offer insights into leadership principles, strategic thinking, and operational excellence. From timeless classics to modern reads, these books can transform your leadership approach and enhance your management skills, covering various topics like organizational culture and employee motivation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--1KxV4ohY--/f_auto/v1722860400/public/Placeholder%2007","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-03T14:06:06.120Z"},{"id":"q